# Local agent config. The repo contract files under .claude/ ARE tracked:
# settings.json and the skills symlink into .agents/. Everything else there is
# per-machine state. (The global layer now lives in AGENTS.md via the vendored
# STACK-GLOBAL block, not a Claude-only global.md + SessionStart hook.)
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/skills

